[{"sha":"aa0bd92cfe376b9ad77a1fee4306776cf7cb4194","node_id":"C_kwDOAFgnJdoAKGFhMGJkOTJjZmUzNzZiOWFkNzdhMWZlZTQzMDY3NzZjZjdjYjQxOTQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"Yoav Weiss","email":"yoav@yoav.ws","date":"2026-06-25T06:35:58Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-25T06:35:58Z"},"message":"Add TAO destination check for navigation redirect chains\n\nTiming-Allow-Origin (TAO) currently only opts-in \"backwards\" in terms of origins and doesn't constitute an opt-in to the destination origin, which is the appropriate opt-in for navigations (contrary to subresources).\n\nThis PR adds the mechanisms that can enable such \"forward\" opt-in, and can enable a navigation response to a redirect chain to know that the redirect chain opted in to expose the redirects to its origin.\n\nTests: https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/60823 & https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/60873.\n\nCorresponding HTML PR: https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/12513.","tree":{"sha":"9cb382c669601a17ec42fbec6db7b03e97d19959","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/fetch/git/trees/9cb382c669601a17ec42fbec6db7b03e97d19959"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/fetch/git/commits/aa0bd92cfe376b9ad77a1fee4306776cf7cb4194","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPMxOCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKrcQAIFCRFKii8aQR00dfGIeI1N7\nkvJxhlm3bplXEpsypXdz0U21KGaIJOu8gLOOP45ufT/UXSZrUNGcvV+YVRnvFUv/\nqS4vKkQ1R9HPghrFkJ0QH4Ion50Lj53eVxZVIECncv+0kWBzV1hJQbxw1+44C+qz\na6A9/z+ziQSt0iqei2Qz+QoaWB0F8kUVmg/FaRlF9X4TO7qnfu1diNGGyXEfR5H7\n7nrubk1Jf3nEXvHw1Hdlf2UEk4jrOe8NEkm2NlPM6jzz9RmwWcl2JsuXI/swoR8m\nuxDcvq2wRyiFhxCHtm5Ej/r4p02wNcSIsmpSmyhOaGyoMLnFeRMl2ln/ZTAZ0yjL\n8WFzK0jG32MrUMAPo8oi0zcFrxCqkJtmP+jWQwrpVQxES9OT9Kmt0Eje3di7fkmr\nWc9Mj4lTjqUkdyDRnJsdC7Gl3d4AOIFQMN9SPQThKzOpfLBdLZ/cMUR+WTAsMQ11\n5IgfjcRFCsaRD2rTkcklwH9rD2Yh6qvD1za+eZZCq6RK0F5sG1Emy2Aim1Hs/l0e\n9ErL0QY8xb0ORv33LS+ReU2nZAJunS09kNOe0Oj4lhODPQJzbKqLK8Oztrw9X8il\ntqIIZQ+UNsjh05Oxzf74tepxvRGiOOas1VVv47TeDJ6d85B7S3TR10Ugve75g7oL\nI9wOuFpVoeO6mr83MI3i\n=kUZS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 9cb382c669601a17ec42fbec6db7b03e97d19959\nparent 45097d986574e33c38b02ca4bd97a389b8b5a0c9\nauthor Yoav Weiss <yoav@yoav.ws> 1782369358 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782369358 +0200\n\nAdd TAO destination check for navigation redirect chains\n\nTiming-Allow-Origin (TAO) currently only opts-in \"backwards\" in terms of origins and doesn't constitute an opt-in to the destination origin, which is the appropriate opt-in for navigations (contrary to subresources).\n\nThis PR adds the mechanisms that can enable such \"forward\" opt-in, and can enable a navigation response to a redirect chain to know that the redirect chain opted in to expose the redirects to its origin.\n\nTests: https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/60823 & https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/60873.\n\nCorresponding HTML PR: https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/12513.","verified_at":"2026-06-25T06:35:59Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/fetch/commits/aa0bd92cfe376b9ad77a1fee4306776cf7cb4194","html_url":"https://github.com/whatwg/fetch/commit/aa0bd92cfe376b9ad77a1fee4306776cf7cb4194","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/fetch/commits/aa0bd92cfe376b9ad77a1fee4306776cf7cb4194/comments","author":{"login":"yoavweiss","id":786187,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4NjE4Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/786187?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoavweiss","html_url":"https://github.com/yoavweiss","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoavweiss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoavweiss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoavweiss/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoavweiss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoa